u-boot-2018 header snapshot
===========================

Preprocessor-resolved dependency closure of the vendor USB/EFEX stack
and the FES shims, copied from the Allwinner Tina SDK u-boot-2018 tree
(brandy/brandy-2.0/u-boot-2018/include and arch/arm/include).  They let
fes/usb build without a U-Boot source tree.

License: GPL-2.0-or-later, as in the upstream files.

Local fix: linux/log2.h drops the noreturn attribute on ____ilog2_NaN(),
which GCC 13 rejects when combined with const.  The function is never
called.

Only the headers the current sources actually include are present.  If
the vendor stack is updated, regenerate the list with `gcc -M` using the
include set of ../Makefile.
